fonts-okolaks (0.6.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * debian/changelog
    - Trim trailing whitespace.
  * debian/control
    - Use secure URI in Homepage field.
    - Bump debhelper from deprecated 9 to 13.
    - Set debhelper-compat version in Build-Depends.
    - Update Vcs-* headers to use salsa repository.
    - Split Build-Depends to Build-Depends-Indep
    - Set Standards-Version: 4.5.1
    - Drop obsolete dependencies with ttf-okolaks
    - Drop unnecessary Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
    - Update Maintainer's address
    - Update Uploaders (Closes: #927581)
  * debian/rules
    - Drop unnecessary override and use default compression
  * Drop unnecessary debian/preinst for defoma
  * Drop harmful bz2 compression setting (debian/gbp.conf)
  * debian/copyright
    - Convert to copyright format 1.0
  * Add debian/salsa-ci.yml

