fonts-okolaks (0.5-6) unstable; urgency=low

  * Team upload
  * Fix homepage in debian/control for something that actually work.
    Not sure this is the official homepage but things are not really clear.
    Closes: #646950
  * Update Standards to 3.9.5 (checked)
  * Bump debhelper compatibility to 9
  * Drop transitional package
  * Add 'Multi-Arch: foreign' field
